1
00:00:00,710 --> 00:00:02,540
We will win! We will win!

2
00:00:03,210 --> 00:00:06,710
When this tournament is over, I'll be alone again.

3
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:10,300
I won't be able to play football with these kids anymore.

4
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:13,720
I may be in France, but I am Japanese.

5
00:00:14,350 --> 00:00:18,810
From now on, I want to represent Japan, wear this flag and fight.

6
00:00:19,930 --> 00:00:21,730
Look at me.

7
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:23,100
Dad!

8
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:25,020
Taro.

9
00:00:25,570 --> 00:00:28,740
The referee looks at his watch.

10
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:30,700
Only a few seconds left.

11
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:33,490
And there's one person left from the French team.

12
00:00:33,570 --> 00:00:35,620
Pierre-kun is waiting!

13
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:39,750
One-on-one. Let's settle it here, Misaki.

14
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,750
Bring it on, Pierre.

15
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:45,000
This is my final gamble.

16
00:00:47,250 --> 00:00:51,260
Oh, Misaki-kun kicks the ball behind Pierre-kun.

17
00:00:51,550 --> 00:00:52,380
What?

18
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:55,510
But his kick was too weak.

19
00:00:56,050 --> 00:00:59,680
Oh, the ball stops in a puddle.

20
00:00:59,770 --> 00:01:02,640
Misaki-kun suddenly sprints at full speed.

21
00:01:02,730 --> 00:01:04,940
Pierre-kun also turns and chases after him.

22
00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:06,480
The goalkeeper comes out too.

23
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:09,230
Pierre turned and then ran.

24
00:01:09,320 --> 00:01:11,780
Whereas I must accelerate thanks to my dribbling.

25
00:01:12,320 --> 00:01:14,610
I'll reach the ball first!

26
00:01:15,110 --> 00:01:17,120
And then it's over!

27
00:01:17,620 --> 00:01:23,370
What happened! Misaki-kun slides on the ground with a tackle to boost his speed.

28
00:01:23,460 --> 00:01:26,250
This is Misaki-kun's tackle shot.

29
00:01:26,330 --> 00:01:28,210
- Nice!\N- You did it, Misaki!

30
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:30,210
Not yet, I'm here!

31
00:01:30,710 --> 00:01:34,720
Napoleon-kun comes from the side and blocks him.

32
00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:39,720
Japan can't score on their final attack.

33
00:01:39,810 --> 00:01:41,720
- Napoleon!\N- Well done!

34
00:01:42,430 --> 00:01:44,770
I can't do it! There's no chance left.

35
00:01:44,850 --> 00:01:46,730
Don't give up, Misaki-kun!

36
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:52,280
Tsubasa-kun comes from behind...

37
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:54,610
and presses on Misaki-kun's blocked foot.

38
00:01:54,900 --> 00:01:59,120
They break Napoleon's barricade! The Golden Duo is in good shape.

39
00:01:59,410 --> 00:02:00,410
Good.

40
00:02:01,740 --> 00:02:03,620
Misaki-kun jumps.

41
00:02:04,580 --> 00:02:08,170
And immediately, on the ball in the air,

42
00:02:08,710 --> 00:02:10,500
he executes an overhead kick!

43
00:02:12,090 --> 00:02:16,760
Goal! Misaki-kun's shot enters France's goal!

44
00:02:17,220 --> 00:02:21,760
This goal! Misaki-kun's goal is accepted.

45
00:02:22,270 --> 00:02:26,230
The Japan team stubbornly scored just before the match ended.

46
00:02:26,310 --> 00:02:29,650
Now the score is 4-4, it's a draw.

47
00:02:29,770 --> 00:02:33,150
The match goes into two 10-minute extra time periods.

48
00:02:33,900 --> 00:02:35,240
Great.

49
00:02:35,320 --> 00:02:41,120
Now I can play football with Tsubasa-kun and the others for 20 more minutes.

50
00:02:41,700 --> 00:02:42,790
Misaki-kun.

51
00:03:00,890 --> 00:03:05,770
CAPTAIN TSUBASA: JUNIOR YOUTH ARC

52
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:24,960
Episode 24: Extra Time in the Rain

53
00:04:25,330 --> 00:04:26,630
You were great, Misaki.

54
00:04:26,710 --> 00:04:28,130
You saved us.

55
00:04:28,210 --> 00:04:29,960
Your shot was great, Misaki.

56
00:04:30,420 --> 00:04:32,090
D-Damn it.

57
00:04:32,380 --> 00:04:34,430
We were so close to winning.

58
00:04:34,470 --> 00:04:36,840
Only a few minutes were left.

59
00:04:38,430 --> 00:04:41,390
You finally beat me, Misaki.

60
00:04:41,470 --> 00:04:45,440
But now I'll make up for it.

61
00:04:46,770 --> 00:04:49,980
Guys, regret is useless.

62
00:04:50,070 --> 00:04:52,360
Forget about it and attack with all our strength.

63
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:53,610
Okay!

64
00:05:03,370 --> 00:05:06,000
Guys, you fought well for the equalizer.

65
00:05:06,170 --> 00:05:08,210
Work hard in extra time too.

66
00:05:08,330 --> 00:05:10,630
We'll beat them with our fighting spirit.

67
00:05:10,710 --> 00:05:11,630
Okay.

68
00:05:12,550 --> 00:05:15,720
I'm truly very happy, guys.

69
00:05:16,220 --> 00:05:21,390
But I made a mistake by only thinking about the equalizer.

70
00:05:22,140 --> 00:05:24,850
I only had three substitutions available.

71
00:05:25,020 --> 00:05:29,560
I used the substitutions without thinking about extra time.

72
00:05:31,190 --> 00:05:36,900
And I put players on the field who are not in condition to play the full extra time.

73
00:05:37,530 --> 00:05:43,160
Furthermore, with Soda sent off, Japan has to fight with a numerical disadvantage.

74
00:05:43,330 --> 00:05:45,000
And with these injuries,

75
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:49,330
extra time becomes 11 against 7.

76
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:55,090
Soda-san, we're in extra time.

77
00:05:55,840 --> 00:05:59,260
Misaki-san scored the equalizing goal.

78
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:01,050
Extra time?

79
00:06:01,300 --> 00:06:02,430
Yes.

80
00:06:02,510 --> 00:06:04,270
Are the guys coming here?

81
00:06:04,470 --> 00:06:09,100
No, it's a short break, they're resting in the locker room.

82
00:06:10,150 --> 00:06:13,900
I see. I know I have no right to ask for this.

83
00:06:13,980 --> 00:06:16,110
But please tell them I'm praying. Do your best.

84
00:06:16,860 --> 00:06:20,160
There's nothing else I can do.

85
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:22,240
Okay, understood.

86
00:06:23,030 --> 00:06:28,000
And don't worry. All the guys are saying they want you to play in the final.

87
00:06:30,750 --> 00:06:33,380
Thank you, guys.

88
00:06:36,460 --> 00:06:37,380
Misugi.

89
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:40,180
We have no substitutions left.

90
00:06:40,260 --> 00:06:43,640
Think about your heart in this extra time, too.

91
00:06:43,810 --> 00:06:45,930
Please be careful.

92
00:06:46,020 --> 00:06:47,640
Understood.

93
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:50,850
Ah, same goes for you, Tachibana.

94
00:06:50,940 --> 00:06:53,770
I want you to focus on defense.

95
00:06:54,320 --> 00:06:57,360
Attacking is too bad for your injuries.

96
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:59,740
Okay, Tsubasa.

97
00:06:59,820 --> 00:07:01,240
Sorry, guys.

98
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:05,660
Our Space Storm didn't work, and now we've become a burden to you.

99
00:07:05,910 --> 00:07:07,450
Don't say that.

100
00:07:07,540 --> 00:07:11,670
The Space Storm made Misaki's dribbling possible and we got the equalizer.

101
00:07:11,750 --> 00:07:13,170
That's right, Tachibana.

102
00:07:13,750 --> 00:07:19,920
And the other defenders should make more effort to lighten Misugi-kun's load.

103
00:07:20,050 --> 00:07:23,050
Yes. We'll defend with all our being.

104
00:07:23,140 --> 00:07:24,850
Leave the defense to us.

105
00:07:24,930 --> 00:07:27,430
We've come this far, we won't give up now.

106
00:07:28,220 --> 00:07:30,520
Tsubasa-kun, guys.

107
00:07:34,020 --> 00:07:36,820
Is your hand okay, Wakashimazu?

108
00:07:36,900 --> 00:07:37,820
Tsubasa!

109
00:07:39,190 --> 00:07:41,150
During the Hamburg match,

110
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:43,780
you were injured by Schneider's shot...

111
00:07:43,870 --> 00:07:45,580
It must hurt a lot.

112
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:47,790
It's fine, Tsubasa.

113
00:07:47,870 --> 00:07:50,040
We can't substitute anymore.

114
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:54,920
I, Ken Wakashimazu, will defend Japan's goal with all my strength at all costs.

115
00:07:55,630 --> 00:07:56,460
Okay.

116
00:07:59,880 --> 00:08:04,010
Guys, we're leaving the attack to Hyuga-kun now.

117
00:08:04,300 --> 00:08:08,140
Misaki-kun and I will focus on defense.

118
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:13,980
If an attacking opportunity arises, leave it to me, Misaki-kun, and Hyuga-kun.

119
00:08:16,020 --> 00:08:20,440
The rest of you stay back and defend.

120
00:08:20,820 --> 00:08:23,110
We're one man down and injured.

121
00:08:23,320 --> 00:08:25,570
We have no other choice right now.

122
00:08:25,910 --> 00:08:27,530
Do you understand, guys?

123
00:08:27,620 --> 00:08:28,910
Yes.

124
00:08:29,330 --> 00:08:30,580
Tsubasa.

125
00:08:31,830 --> 00:08:35,000
As a coach, I was almost giving up.

126
00:08:35,380 --> 00:08:38,920
But you still haven't given up.

127
00:08:40,090 --> 00:08:43,800
You've become a worthy and reliable captain, Tsubasa.

128
00:08:44,470 --> 00:08:47,760
The name Captain Tsubasa truly suits you.

129
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:50,260
Alright, let's go.

130
00:08:56,310 --> 00:08:57,440
Guys!

131
00:08:57,860 --> 00:08:59,820
Guys, do your best!

132
00:08:59,900 --> 00:09:02,650
Soda-san asked me to pass this on.

133
00:09:02,990 --> 00:09:03,820
Okay!

134
00:09:03,900 --> 00:09:06,240
We're also fighting for Soda.

135
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:07,490
In extra time!

136
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:10,120
We still have 20 minutes.

137
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:13,870
Pierre's jumping shot, Napoleon's Cannon Shot,

138
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:16,330
and the duo's Eiffel Attack.

139
00:09:16,460 --> 00:09:19,340
You have to stop them all, okay?

140
00:09:19,460 --> 00:09:20,670
Okay!

141
00:09:29,010 --> 00:09:31,890
Both teams have taken the field.

142
00:09:32,180 --> 00:09:36,440
Extra time begins, 20 minutes total with the first and second periods.

143
00:09:37,350 --> 00:09:40,270
The Japan team has tied the score.

144
00:09:40,980 --> 00:09:43,230
They're fighting very hard.

145
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:46,900
Yes, but the fact that the situation is bad doesn't change.

146
00:09:46,990 --> 00:09:50,030
France will certainly attack more fiercely in extra time.

147
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:53,080
Let's see how Japan will defend.

148
00:09:53,580 --> 00:09:58,670
And of course, the one holding the team together is Ozora Tsubasa.

149
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:02,920
Let's see if he can keep his devastated team alive.

150
00:10:03,500 --> 00:10:07,680
Once again, it starts with France's kickoff.

151
00:10:07,880 --> 00:10:09,470
Good luck, France!

152
00:10:09,550 --> 00:10:11,180
We trust you, Pierre!

153
00:10:11,510 --> 00:10:12,970
Come on, Napoleon.

154
00:10:13,060 --> 00:10:13,890
Okay.

155
00:10:14,350 --> 00:10:17,480
Pierre-kun and Napoleon-kun, France's Golden Duo,

156
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:20,940
immediately start the Eiffel Attack!

157
00:10:21,020 --> 00:10:22,770
We're going too, Misaki-kun.

158
00:10:22,860 --> 00:10:23,650
Okay.

159
00:10:24,150 --> 00:10:27,070
Misaki-kun from Japan goes to intercept the passing.

160
00:10:28,490 --> 00:10:29,320
Catch!

161
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:31,370
Nice.

162
00:10:31,450 --> 00:10:33,910
Napoleon-kun clearly anticipated that!

163
00:10:33,990 --> 00:10:36,330
He lobs the ball over Misaki-kun's head.

164
00:10:37,620 --> 00:10:39,290
We won't fall for this tactic again.

165
00:10:39,370 --> 00:10:40,210
What?

166
00:10:40,290 --> 00:10:44,210
But Tsubasa-kun is there! The Eiffel Attack is broken up!

167
00:10:44,300 --> 00:10:45,840
Combination play against combination play.

168
00:10:45,920 --> 00:10:48,300
This time, Japan's Golden Duo wins!

169
00:10:48,380 --> 00:10:50,090
Catch, Hyuga-kun!

170
00:10:50,300 --> 00:10:51,340
Nice.

171
00:10:51,550 --> 00:10:53,390
Advance, Hyuga-san!

172
00:10:53,470 --> 00:10:54,470
We're counting on you!

173
00:10:55,180 --> 00:10:57,980
Everyone is relying on me for the attack.

174
00:10:58,060 --> 00:11:02,860
I, Kojiro Hyuga, will score against France.

175
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:06,610
Hyuga starts his special direct dribbling.

176
00:11:08,990 --> 00:11:10,660
Good, advance, Hyuga!

177
00:11:10,740 --> 00:11:12,740
You have to turn this into a goal!

178
00:11:12,950 --> 00:11:15,740
Please Hyuga, you're our only hope.

179
00:11:15,870 --> 00:11:16,700
Stop him!

180
00:11:16,790 --> 00:11:20,580
We won't be humiliated in front of this crowd.

181
00:11:20,670 --> 00:11:21,500
Okay.

182
00:11:23,330 --> 00:11:24,630
Catch, here it comes!

183
00:11:24,710 --> 00:11:27,630
France tackles with three players.

184
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:29,510
I'll force my way through.

185
00:11:29,920 --> 00:11:30,880
Kojiro.

186
00:11:31,970 --> 00:11:33,800
What a huge splash of water!

187
00:11:33,890 --> 00:11:37,020
It's not even clear if the tackle touched the ball.

188
00:11:39,390 --> 00:11:42,400
Good, let's go! It's our turn to attack!

189
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:44,520
Damn it.

190
00:11:44,610 --> 00:11:45,770
Hyuga-san!

191
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:49,780
That was a foul.

192
00:11:51,610 --> 00:11:53,360
France attacks!

193
00:11:53,450 --> 00:11:58,410
The ball goes to none other than the elegant bull, El Sid Pierre-kun.

194
00:11:59,790 --> 00:12:01,370
El Sid Pierre.

195
00:12:02,290 --> 00:12:06,130
He played flawlessly up to the semifinal.

196
00:12:06,460 --> 00:12:10,670
But in this match, nothing went as planned.

197
00:12:11,630 --> 00:12:14,090
Japan disrupted their game repeatedly.

198
00:12:14,800 --> 00:12:18,100
Compared to when I had a friendly match with them,

199
00:12:18,350 --> 00:12:20,980
Japan has truly improved incredibly.

200
00:12:21,640 --> 00:12:26,560
But France's Pierre hasn't changed.

201
00:12:27,650 --> 00:12:31,030
Come on! I'll show who's boss in extra time.

202
00:12:34,660 --> 00:12:35,490
No!

203
00:12:35,570 --> 00:12:38,660
The Tachibana brothers are frozen.

204
00:12:38,740 --> 00:12:43,120
So their injuries from the Space Storm in the Argentina match have gotten worse?

205
00:12:43,710 --> 00:12:45,920
Likewise, Misugi-kun's condition is worrying.

206
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:48,290
He's now played more than 20 minutes.

207
00:12:48,380 --> 00:12:53,720
And Hyuga-kun is a bit shaken from the French tackle and can't get up.

208
00:12:54,880 --> 00:12:58,180
Pierre-kun continues dribbling.

209
00:12:58,260 --> 00:13:01,140
Will he go all the way and shoot?

210
00:13:01,270 --> 00:13:04,770
Oh, Misaki-kun comes to block his path.

211
00:13:04,890 --> 00:13:06,190
Bring it on, Misaki.

212
00:13:06,270 --> 00:13:10,150
I'll get past you and make up for the goal you scored.

213
00:13:10,570 --> 00:13:13,400
Bring it on, Pierre, I won't lose.

214
00:13:13,570 --> 00:13:15,110
I won't lose!

215
00:13:15,780 --> 00:13:18,160
But this won't repeat like in the first half!

216
00:13:18,240 --> 00:13:20,410
This time Misaki-kun stops him!

217
00:13:22,580 --> 00:13:26,920
But the ball rebounds to where Napoleon-kun is.

218
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:27,920
Get ready.

219
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:32,210
I'll score 2 goals in this extra time and tie with Schneider.

220
00:13:32,300 --> 00:13:35,300
I want to go to the final with three hat-tricks in three matches.

221
00:13:35,630 --> 00:13:36,840
I'll stop him.

222
00:13:36,930 --> 00:13:37,930
Misugi.

223
00:13:38,050 --> 00:13:41,430
No one can stop me!

224
00:13:42,470 --> 00:13:46,640
Napoleon-kun uses force to push Misugi-kun away!

225
00:13:46,730 --> 00:13:47,690
Misugi-kun!

226
00:13:49,610 --> 00:13:51,270
Catch, here it comes!

227
00:13:53,530 --> 00:13:56,450
This is Napoleon-kun's Cannon Shot!

228
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:02,370
Wakashimazu-kun reacts immediately!

229
00:14:02,450 --> 00:14:04,750
He saves with an incredible one-handed dive!

230
00:14:04,830 --> 00:14:06,580
You were great, Wakashimazu!

231
00:14:09,580 --> 00:14:11,420
Oh, Wakashimazu-kun.

232
00:14:11,500 --> 00:14:13,090
So his injury,

233
00:14:13,170 --> 00:14:16,340
got worse while stopping Schneider-kun's shot in the friendly match against Hamburg?

234
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:21,100
And is Misugi-kun okay after colliding with Napoleon-kun?

235
00:14:23,640 --> 00:14:26,680
This is exactly what I was afraid of.

236
00:14:27,190 --> 00:14:30,560
The Japan team is facing a flood of injuries.

237
00:14:30,650 --> 00:14:34,610
Extra time has just begun, but they can no longer make substitutions.

238
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:40,200
They may be tied, but this is a life-or-death situation right now.

239
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:42,490
G-Guys.

240
00:14:48,730 --> 00:14:50,980
Born: December 25 | Height: 170 cm | Weight: 63 kg | Blood Type: B

241
00:14:57,070 --> 00:14:58,650
No, I don't want that.

242
00:15:15,420 --> 00:15:17,210
Guys, don't give up.

243
00:15:18,250 --> 00:15:20,300
Now is not the time to give up!

244
00:15:20,550 --> 00:15:23,930
We will win, I swear on it!

245
00:15:25,050 --> 00:15:26,300
Hyuga-kun.

246
00:15:26,640 --> 00:15:28,010
Kojiro.

247
00:15:28,100 --> 00:15:30,480
Leave the defense to us.

248
00:15:30,560 --> 00:15:33,900
Right, we've come this far, it's impossible for us to lose.

249
00:15:33,980 --> 00:15:37,020
We'll cover for the injured.

250
00:15:37,230 --> 00:15:39,650
Me too! Keep defending!

251
00:15:39,730 --> 00:15:41,860
We will not lose!

252
00:15:41,940 --> 00:15:43,150
We don't lose!

253
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:46,030
Even if my hand breaks, I won't concede any goal.

254
00:15:46,820 --> 00:15:48,950
That's it, guys, don't give up!

255
00:15:49,240 --> 00:15:52,040
- Let's cheer loudly until the end! - Okay!

256
00:15:58,000 --> 00:16:01,340
Guys, we have to cheer as loudly as we can!

257
00:16:01,460 --> 00:16:02,550
Okay!

258
00:16:04,470 --> 00:16:05,930
I trust you, Tsubasa.

259
00:16:08,050 --> 00:16:09,470
Alright, let's go, Misaki-kun.

260
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:14,190
The guys are covering us from behind, we're the only ones who can score.

261
00:16:14,270 --> 00:16:15,810
Yes, Tsubasa-kun.

262
00:16:16,730 --> 00:16:18,480
Japan restarts the game,

263
00:16:18,560 --> 00:16:21,070
with an attack from Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun.

264
00:16:21,150 --> 00:16:23,820
They attack with the Golden Duo.

265
00:16:24,030 --> 00:16:26,950
Please, please Tsubasa, Misaki!

266
00:16:27,070 --> 00:16:29,990
Don't lose, Japan has no strength left.

267
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:32,790
If we can get the ball back, we can score.

268
00:16:32,870 --> 00:16:33,710
Okay!

269
00:16:33,790 --> 00:16:36,460
Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun are trying to infiltrate.

270
00:16:36,670 --> 00:16:37,960
Crush them!

271
00:16:38,170 --> 00:16:40,210
- Let's go, Misaki-kun. - Okay.

272
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:41,800
What?

273
00:16:41,880 --> 00:16:44,470
Tsubasa-kun sends the ball into the air.

274
00:16:44,630 --> 00:16:45,630
Alright.

275
00:16:46,220 --> 00:16:47,390
Now.

276
00:16:47,470 --> 00:16:50,140
Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun execute a twin shot.

277
00:16:50,220 --> 00:16:52,850
They display that incredible technique from three years ago.

278
00:16:52,930 --> 00:16:55,730
Only this time, they do a twin shot in the air!

279
00:16:55,890 --> 00:16:57,730
Come on!

280
00:16:59,860 --> 00:17:02,980
The ball goes directly towards France's goal.

281
00:17:03,150 --> 00:17:05,240
Ah... What's this?

282
00:17:05,320 --> 00:17:06,240
Damn it.

283
00:17:06,780 --> 00:17:08,740
The goalkeeper jumps but can't catch it!

284
00:17:08,820 --> 00:17:10,740
We did it, we took the lead.

285
00:17:12,370 --> 00:17:13,240
What bad luck!

286
00:17:13,330 --> 00:17:16,660
It changed direction and hit the post!

287
00:17:16,750 --> 00:17:19,670
Unfortunately, the twin shot wasn't a goal.

288
00:17:19,750 --> 00:17:22,210
D-Damn it, we were so close to winning.

289
00:17:23,090 --> 00:17:24,460
We're saved.

290
00:17:24,550 --> 00:17:27,720
Attack! Hurry up! Give me the ball!

291
00:17:28,510 --> 00:17:34,020
Losing to a Japan playing with 10 men and a bunch of injuries would be humiliating for France!

292
00:17:34,100 --> 00:17:37,980
We, the France team, will score the winning goal.

293
00:17:38,390 --> 00:17:40,190
Pi-Pierre.

294
00:17:40,520 --> 00:17:45,570
It seems Pierre's patience has finally run out.

295
00:17:45,820 --> 00:17:51,120
France is superior, but Japan stubbornly resists.

296
00:17:51,370 --> 00:17:53,620
The secret weapon we kept for the final...

297
00:17:53,700 --> 00:17:57,210
We had to use it in this match.

298
00:17:57,910 --> 00:18:03,380
You must win this match using all the energy and technique you know, guys.

299
00:18:03,460 --> 00:18:06,130
You have to win this match, guys.

300
00:18:08,220 --> 00:18:10,970
Pierre-kun starts dribbling.

301
00:18:11,050 --> 00:18:13,510
I was selected for the youth team.

302
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:16,220
But the real reason I accepted the captaincy position for France youth,

303
00:18:16,310 --> 00:18:19,890
was so that France could win this tournament.

304
00:18:20,310 --> 00:18:23,150
It's impossible for us to lose here.

305
00:18:23,820 --> 00:18:29,030
This could be our last match in this tournament.

306
00:18:30,240 --> 00:18:32,160
Yes, I know.

307
00:18:32,910 --> 00:18:40,080
The final. We must win this match so the kids can fight in the final for us.

308
00:18:40,250 --> 00:18:42,790
We'll give all our strength to this match.

309
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:44,710
We're not thinking about the final at all.

310
00:18:44,790 --> 00:18:47,170
We're putting all our energy into this match.

311
00:18:47,260 --> 00:18:48,670
Follow Pierre!

312
00:18:48,760 --> 00:18:50,090
We're advancing too.

313
00:18:50,170 --> 00:18:54,300
France attacks like a wave together with Pierre-kun.

314
00:18:54,510 --> 00:18:58,180
It would not be surprising if Japan's goal lock breaks at any moment.

315
00:18:58,390 --> 00:18:59,890
Come on, Pierre.

316
00:18:59,980 --> 00:19:01,600
Shoot!

317
00:19:01,690 --> 00:19:03,810
Catch it!

318
00:19:09,820 --> 00:19:10,860
What!?

319
00:19:10,950 --> 00:19:13,110
But Japan defends!

320
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:18,200
Goalkeeper Wakashimazu-kun saves Pierre-kun's jumping shot with a cross deflection due to his injury.

321
00:19:18,490 --> 00:19:21,710
I can no longer catch with my right palm.

322
00:19:21,790 --> 00:19:23,960
I must do my best not to give them a rebound.

323
00:19:24,750 --> 00:19:28,050
Defense! We defend with all our heart and soul.

324
00:19:28,130 --> 00:19:32,840
The field's nobleman, Misugi-kun, defended Japan's goal.

325
00:19:32,930 --> 00:19:34,220
You were great, Misugi.

326
00:19:34,890 --> 00:19:38,390
Wakashimazu-kun and Misugi-kun are putting in so much effort.

327
00:19:38,470 --> 00:19:41,230
We must do our part too.

328
00:19:41,560 --> 00:19:43,690
Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun, who are in midfield,

329
00:19:43,770 --> 00:19:45,730
go back and defend the goal.

330
00:19:46,360 --> 00:19:48,610
Who are these guys?

331
00:19:48,690 --> 00:19:50,740
Why don't they give up?

332
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:53,740
Attack, France, don't give up.

333
00:19:53,820 --> 00:19:55,740
Score a goal!

334
00:19:55,820 --> 00:19:59,240
The end of the first extra time period is near.

335
00:19:59,330 --> 00:20:02,210
But France's fierce attacks continue.

336
00:20:02,290 --> 00:20:04,920
Do your best, guys.

337
00:20:06,170 --> 00:20:08,170
I'm sure you'll find an opportunity.

338
00:20:08,250 --> 00:20:10,050
Hold on, Tsubasa-kun.

339
00:20:12,590 --> 00:20:16,510
Ishizaki-kun, in his unique way, catches Bossi-kun's shot with his face.

340
00:20:16,760 --> 00:20:17,850
Catch.

341
00:20:17,930 --> 00:20:20,350
Jito-kun immediately clears it.

342
00:20:20,430 --> 00:20:24,140
Japan defends, but the ball comes to France again.

343
00:20:24,230 --> 00:20:25,060
Get ready.

344
00:20:25,140 --> 00:20:27,150
I'm France's best forward.

345
00:20:27,230 --> 00:20:28,770
I'll score a hat-trick.

346
00:20:28,860 --> 00:20:32,150
I, Louis Napoleon, will be the top scorer of this tournament.

347
00:20:32,240 --> 00:20:35,570
Come on! Cannon Shot!

348
00:20:35,660 --> 00:20:39,660
Napoleon-kun fires the Cannon Shot with all his might.

349
00:20:39,740 --> 00:20:40,990
This is mine!

350
00:20:41,160 --> 00:20:42,000
What?

351
00:20:42,160 --> 00:20:43,540
I was waiting for this!

352
00:20:43,620 --> 00:20:45,870
Now I'll return your shot!

353
00:20:47,460 --> 00:20:49,880
This...

354
00:20:50,040 --> 00:20:53,590
is my new Tiger Shot!

355
00:20:53,920 --> 00:20:56,130
Hyuga-kun returns the shot!

356
00:20:56,220 --> 00:20:59,010
Tiger Shot versus Cannon Shot!

357
00:20:59,100 --> 00:20:59,930
What?

358
00:21:00,010 --> 00:21:01,720
- Awesome!\N- Wow!

359
00:21:01,810 --> 00:21:03,140
Come on!

360
00:21:04,430 --> 00:21:07,350
The ball goes directly towards France's goal.

361
00:21:12,230 --> 00:21:14,570
The first period ends! Not a goal!

362
00:21:14,650 --> 00:21:16,150
Not a goal!

363
00:21:16,490 --> 00:21:22,450
Hyuga-kun's long-distance shot was a goal, but unfortunately the referee says no goal.

364
00:21:22,540 --> 00:21:26,410
It seems the final whistle blew right as he made his shot.

365
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:30,880
Damn it, if it had been a goal one second earlier...

366
00:21:30,960 --> 00:21:34,460
Another goal canceled for Japan!

367
00:21:34,550 --> 00:21:36,670
The first period ends in a draw.

368
00:21:37,510 --> 00:21:39,760
That was very close, Hyuga-kun.

369
00:21:39,840 --> 00:21:40,800
Yes.

370
00:21:41,800 --> 00:21:43,640
You guys were great.

371
00:21:43,720 --> 00:21:46,810
In the first extra period, Japan was relentlessly attacked.

372
00:21:46,890 --> 00:21:49,480
But they managed to create a shock at the last moment.

373
00:21:49,560 --> 00:21:51,150
Anyway, the match

374
00:21:51,230 --> 00:21:53,940
continues for another 10 minutes.

375
00:21:54,730 --> 00:21:57,280
Wh-What incredible strength.

376
00:21:57,950 --> 00:21:59,910
Pi-Pierre.

377
00:23:46,500 --> 00:23:50,040
NEXT EPISODE: AN INJURED LAST STAND